portunities that we  offer to students we need to  sustain a strong talent pool with  multi-disciplinary training  and then we strongly recommend that we  work together  across academics and industry to bring  these opportunities to support the  growth of our industry into the future  and i appreciate your attention i  understand that  questions will be forwarded through  email so i appreciate your  questions and look forward to more  collaboration into the future  thank you

